			MEM_ADR_FAIL:
CP/M ASM86 1.1  SOURCE: T186MON.A86   THUNDER 186 Rev 0.1 4/27/84					       PAGE   8


 0187 0D0A4D656D6F		DB	CR,LF,'Memory address test failure',cr,lf,0
      727920616464
      726573732074
